// These are general NPC messages, said by male NPC's to female PC's

// Offer directions messages start at 100 and end at 199

{100}{Where do you need directions to?}
{101}{Where do you need directions to?}
{102}{Where are you looking to go?}
{103}{Where are you looking to go?}
{104}{What place do you seek?}
{105}{What place do you seek?}
{106}{What place are you looking for?}
{107}{What place are you looking for?}
{108}{Where are you going?}
{109}{Where are you going?}
{110}{What place do you search for?}
{111}{Where are you trying to get to?}
{112}{Where are you trying to get to?}
{113}{I can give you good directions.}
{114}{I have a good knowledge of the area.}
{115}{I have been all around these parts.}
{116}{I know directions to just about anywhere.}
{117}{Directions? I can give directions.}
{118}{You will not get lost with my directions.}
{119}{Where do you want to go?}
{120}{What you are looking for?}
{121}{Travelling, are ye? Where to?}
{122}{Vacationing, are ye? Where to?}
{123}{Off rambling about the countryside, eh? Where to next?}

